## SQ-MXS-01 | mixed seeds: no load error, tags
@group A
@commands (RERUN: nested jar 2026-11-02, run plan in SQ-CDJ5) Boot; `grep -nE "mixed_seeds\|Error occurred while handling event" logs/latest.log logs/kubejs/server.log \| head`; `/dumptags` or `/kubejs`: item tags `vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants`, `forge:seeds`
@pass no error naming mixed_seeds; the plant tag holds wheat, beetroot, `farmersdelight:cabbage_seeds`, melon and pumpkin seeds; `forge:seeds` holds `vintagedelight:mixed_seeds`
@fails Unknown item: the `-10` jar is not loaded; empty tag: CD `vintagedelight/tags.js` not loaded
@from batches/r1102/b1_main.qb passed
bootreject (?i)mixed_seeds.*(error|unknown)
kjsreject (?i)mixed_seeds.*(error|unknown)
kjsreject Error occurred while handling event.*mixed_seeds
> zq itemtag vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants
> zq itemtag forge:seeds
expect \[zq\] itemtag vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants .*minecraft:wheat_seeds
expect \[zq\] itemtag vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants .*minecraft:beetroot_seeds
expect \[zq\] itemtag vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants .*farmersdelight:cabbage_seeds
expect \[zq\] itemtag vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants .*minecraft:melon_seeds
expect \[zq\] itemtag vintagedelight:mixed_seeds_plants .*minecraft:pumpkin_seeds
expect \[zq\] itemtag forge:seeds .*vintagedelight:mixed_seeds

## SQ-MXS-02 | mixed seeds plant mixed crops on farmland, not on grass or stone
@group A
@commands (RERUN: nested jar 2026-11-02, run plan in SQ-CDJ5) Lay 20 farmland with water; give the bot 20 `vintagedelight:mixed_seeds` in survival; it uses one on each farmland; read each block id; then use one on grass and on stone
@pass 20 crops planted, the stack empty, at least four of the five kinds (wheat, beetroots, cabbages, melon stem, pumpkin stem); grass and stone: nothing planted, seed kept (VTD-46)
@fails All one kind: the shuffle failed; seeds kept after planting: shrink missing
@from batches/r1102/b1_main.qb
> fill {H1} {H2-1} {H3+22} {H1+19} {H2-1} {H3+22} minecraft:farmland[moisture=7]
> fill {H1} {H2-1} {H3+23} {H1+19} {H2-1} {H3+23} minecraft:water
> pbot spawn mx {H1+10} {H2} {H3+25} minecraft:overworld survival
> pbot hold mx vintagedelight:mixed_seeds 20
> pbot use mx {H1} {H2-1} {H3+22} up
> pbot use mx {H1+1} {H2-1} {H3+22} up
