# one more seed on grass (natural floor) and on stone: nothing planted, the seed kept
> setblock {H1+3} {H2-1} {H3+26} minecraft:stone
> pbot hold mx vintagedelight:mixed_seeds 1
> pbot use mx {H1} {H2-1} {H3+26} up
> pbot use mx {H1+3} {H2-1} {H3+26} up
> execute if block {H1} {H2} {H3+26} minecraft:air run say MXS02 grass stays empty
> execute if block {H1+3} {H2} {H3+26} minecraft:air run say MXS02 stone stays empty
> data get entity mx SelectedItem
expect MXS02 grass stays empty
expect MXS02 stone stays empty
