look the zcount blocks line: 20 crops, at least four of wheat, beetroots, farmersdelight cabbages, melon_stem, pumpkin_stem

## SQ-MXS-03 | mixed seeds from village chests and from grass (not with shears)
@group A
@commands (RERUN: nested jar 2026-11-02, run plan in SQ-CDJ5) `/loot give @p loot minecraft:chests/village/village_plains_house` 40 times and count Mixed Seeds; bot breaks 300 `minecraft:grass` with an empty hand, then 100 with shears; `grep CE/vintage_mixed_seeds_grass logs/latest.log` if LootJS logging is on
@pass some Mixed Seeds from the chest rolls (share 0.04, 1-4); about 6 from the 300 grass (2 %); none with shears (VTD-79)
@fails none from grass: the LootJS modifier did not load (CD `vintagedelight/loot.js`)
@from batches/r1102/b1_main.qb
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
repeat 40
> loot spawn {H1+40} {H2} {H3+30} loot minecraft:chests/village/village_plains_house
end
sleep 3
> zcount {H1+37} {H2} {H3+27} {H1+43} {H2+3} {H3+33}
> setblock {H1+40} {H2} {H3+36} minecraft:grass
repeat 300
> loot spawn {H1+40} {H2+1} {H3+38} mine {H1+40} {H2} {H3+36}
end
sleep 3
> zcount {H1+38} {H2} {H3+37} {H1+42} {H2+3} {H3+40}
> setblock {H1+46} {H2} {H3+36} minecraft:grass
# the shears case through a bot holding shears: LootJS matchMainHand reads the player's main hand, not the /loot tool
# (r1102 judge: plain /loot mine ... minecraft:shears dropped 2 mixed seeds since no player was in the context)
> pbot spawn mxs {H1+46} {H2} {H3+34} minecraft:overworld survival
> pbot hold mxs minecraft:shears
repeat 100
> execute as mxs run loot spawn {H1+46} {H2+1} {H3+38} mine {H1+46} {H2} {H3+36} minecraft:shears
end
sleep 3
> zcount {H1+44} {H2} {H3+37} {H1+48} {H2+3} {H3+40}
shell grep -c "CE/vintage_mixed_seeds_grass" logs/latest.log; true
look line 1 (chest rolls): some vintagedelight:mixed_seeds (share 0.04, 1-4); line 2 (300 empty-hand grass, /loot mine with no tool): about 6 mixed seeds; line 3 (100 with shears): grass items only, no mixed seeds
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]

