> zq item vintagedelight:red_chefs_hat
> zq item vintagedelight:cheese_pizza
> zq item vintagedelight:meat_pizza
> zq item vintagedelight:cheese_wheel
count item vintagedelight:(red_chefs_hat|cheese_pizza|meat_pizza|cheese_wheel): .*max stack 8$ == 4

## SQ-VTD7-02 | BlockRunner surface tags for Vintage and salt blocks
@group A
@commands `/dumptags` (block): `blockrunner:surface/wood` has `vintagedelight:peanut_crate`; `soft` (0.88x) has `oat_bale`, `oat_bag`, `minecraft:hay_block`, `salt:salt_block`, `vintagedelight:salt_block` (owner decision 2026-11-02, kept 2026-11-03); `salt:raw_rock_salt_block` is in `natural_rough`, not `soft`; `constructed_brick` has `vintagedelight:salt_bricks`; `constructed_smooth` has `smooth_salt_block`; `confectionery` has `cheese_pizza`; log line `BlockRunner tier overlaps` reports 0
@pass all present, 0 overlaps
@fails missing: `blocktags.js` not reloaded
@from batches/r1102b/s3_A.qb
bootexpect BlockRunner tier overlaps checked: \d+ ids, 0 overlap
> zq blocktag blockrunner:surface/wood
> zq blocktag blockrunner:surface/natural_smooth
> zq blocktag blockrunner:surface/constructed_brick
> zq blocktag blockrunner:surface/constructed_smooth
> zq blocktag blockrunner:surface/confectionery
expect blocktag blockrunner:surface/wood \(\d+\): .*vintagedelight:peanut_crate
expect blocktag blockrunner:surface/natural_smooth \(\d+\): .*vintagedelight:oat_bale
expect blocktag blockrunner:surface/natural_smooth \(\d+\): .*salt:salt_block
expect blocktag blockrunner:surface/constructed_brick \(\d+\): .*vintagedelight:salt_bricks
expect blocktag blockrunner:surface/constructed_smooth \(\d+\): .*vintagedelight:smooth_salt_block
expect blocktag blockrunner:surface/confectionery \(\d+\): .*vintagedelight:cheese_pizza

